WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Manufacturing route constrains achievable geometry, tolerances and material state. A process name alone does not determine quality.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Match sheet stock to a forming route, then ask what tooling access and inspection the shape requires.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Process selection

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A material category is not a guarantee of strength, durability or safety. Processing and test conditions matter.

